<BaseLayout title="Friendship in Expat Life | Perspectives | IRMARO" description="One of the realities you have to face after emigrating is loneliness. Suddenly there is nobody to meet on a Friday evening, while building genuine relationships that are meaningful to everyone involved can take years." lang="en" pageKey="perspectives"
